# Line endings: all text files are stored AND checked out as LF on every
# platform (eol=lf overrides native checkout) — one consistent tree, clean
# diffs, and tools like ruff/pytest see identical bytes on Windows and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Lockfiles and vendored assets are text too; keep them LF-normalized.
*.lock text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
